This folder is a college-hackathon edition of Devpost Learn's Build With AI: Basics. Follow `AGENTS.md`.

- If `devpost/floor.md` is missing, read and follow `skills/0-floor/SKILL.md` before any other work.
- Otherwise read `devpost/` and follow the next unfinished skill: `1-start`, `2-scope`, `3-prd`, `4-spec`, `5-build`, `6-ship`.
- When `hackathon/event.md` exists, follow `skills/hackathon-floor.md`.
- The team makes product decisions. Do not draft their pitch, project name, or submission.
- Curriculum files (`skills/`, `hackathon/`, `START.md`, `ORGANIZER.md`, `README.md`) are supposed to be here.
